WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.418
- Zachary! Where's the remote?

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.546
- [Announcer:] Oh, what a catch by Garrett Wilson!

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:06.339
- Ugh, just turn the TV on.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:09.384
- [Brock:] Every off season,
after losing the NFC Championship game,

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:13.680
[Brock:] Coach likes to spend time at the beach
with his expensive offensive weapons.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:16.391
- Woo! Who needs a QB when we're all loaded?!?

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:19.185
- Sorry, kid.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:21.980
I'm not ready to commit
to the whole “franchise QB” thing.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:23.773
- [Brock:] To them that was irrelevant.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:26.276
[Brock:] But this summer, something changed.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.152
Hey guys.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:29.320
- Whoa.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.321
- Brock got hot.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.322
- Au chante.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.493
- [Zach:] Okay, this looks really good.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.411
- Oh, grow up, Zach.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.454
It's a f--king fairy tale.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.166
- Don't you see?

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.250
You're the guy, Brock.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.251
I dumped Trey for you.

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:45.128
- But you gave up so much for him.

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:47.255
Like you did embarrassing things to pursue him, and-

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.131
- Shhhh...

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:52.093
- This is an expensive pop song.

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:53.136
- Ugh, change it!

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:55.388
- Aaron, I have a whole team I need to give attention to- 

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.598
- SOMETHING. ELSE.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:59.768
- Okay, so we pretend you're an elite
QB to make my ex jealous.

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:00.727
- [Rodgers:] I'm not jealous.

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:05.106
- Maybe you are an elite quarterback. 
No, no. It’s too soon.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.649
- [Rodgers:] Anything else!

00:01:07.108 --> 00:01:09.736
- Doug Pederson was hoping to go all the way this year.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.696
And he knew just the partner.

00:01:13.656 --> 00:01:15.992
- Wow. Maybe there is hope
for these young kids after all.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:17.619
- No, being young is bad.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:19.454
It is scary and it is confusing.

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:19.871
Look!

00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:24.667
- Glendale is under attack!

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:28.755
Pew, pew, pew! Shots, shots, explosions! Too much plot! I need help.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.757
- Sorry, fam. That sounds like a Dobbs job.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.009
- Oh hell yeah, this is so terrible I love it.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.013
- Who am I?

00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:39.349
I’m the guy who watched Goldmember a thousand times. Who are you?

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:44.354
- [VO:] Nathaniel Hackett IS...

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.773
The OC.

